From 9ce695a7f9adf0d2ff6cd2c27c11ccc825924986 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 20:33:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] FX: track inserts again with ORDER, shared slots SEND or
 MASTER, DELAY; DUSK theme; weights for the Felucca engines

- Track racks run their three slots as CHAIN inserts again (any audio
  effect or note effect); KNOB 3 sets ORDER.
- Shared slots: KNOB 3 sets USE (SEND or MASTER); a MASTER slot runs on
  the whole mix before punch and MASTER volume. ROUTE moves to RETURN.
- DELAY: a tempo-synced half-rate delay (1/32 .. 1/2, up to 0.74 s),
  feedback and tone. REVERB and DELAY run once each across all racks.
- fx_state lives in the pool; older projects' track inserts load again.
- DUSK colour theme: CONTRAST with muted purple, pink, yellow, green tracks.
- GLO WEIGHTS: P5 FM6 DRUM PHASE / LOFI VOICE TRIO WHEEL / PHYS BUDGET
  GUARD; CZ-1 and SID rows removed from the shipping build.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0131vpfZVN4vprBnQkpmn5yn
