       <section id="effects">
         <h2>Effects</h2>
-        <p>Press <kbd>FX</kbd> to open the selected track’s rack: three note-effect slots for NOTE TAIL and NOTE ECHO, followed by a Shared row. Audio processors run in SHARED; each track sends audio to that shared rack. Effects save with the project and template. Loading a sound, changing the engine, Init sound and sound undo leave them in place.</p>
+        <p>Every effect sits in one of two racks, routed as in Araminta’s EFFECTS list: <strong>CHAIN</strong> on a track, <strong>SEND</strong> or <strong>MASTER</strong> in the shared rack. Press <kbd>FX</kbd> to open the selected track’s rack: three insert slots that run in series, then a Shared row. A slot holds any audio effect or a note effect (NOTE TAIL, NOTE ECHO). Effects, USE and routing save with the project and template; changing a sound keeps them.</p>
         <div class="shots">
-          <figure class="shot"><img src="fx_rack.png" alt="Track effects rack" width="240" height="240"><figcaption>FX: note-effect slots and the Shared row.</figcaption></figure>
-          <figure class="shot"><img src="fx_shared.png" alt="Shared effects rack" width="240" height="240"><figcaption>SHARED: slots A–C, ROUTE and RETURN.</figcaption></figure>
+          <figure class="shot"><img src="fx_rack.png" alt="Track effects rack" width="240" height="240"><figcaption>FX: three insert slots and the Shared row.</figcaption></figure>
+          <figure class="shot"><img src="fx_shared.png" alt="Shared effects rack" width="240" height="240"><figcaption>SHARED: slots A–C (each SEND or MASTER) and RETURN.</figcaption></figure>
           <figure class="shot"><img src="fx_tone_dark.png" alt="Effect tone filter set to dark" width="240" height="240"><figcaption>TONE: the lit band reaches the effect.</figcaption></figure>
         </div>
-        <p>On the rack, <kbd>KNOB 2</kbd> picks a row, <kbd>KNOB 1</kbd> chooses its effect, and <kbd>KNOB 4</kbd> sets its amount (NOTE TAIL’s REL, NOTE ECHO’s LEVEL, or the track’s SEND on the Shared row in CHAIN mode). Empty slots show <strong>--</strong>. <kbd>OCT+</kbd> opens the selected slot, its effect picker if empty, or the SHARED rack. <kbd>SELECT</kbd> visits the racks and occupied slots; empty slot pages are skipped. Pressing <kbd>FX</kbd> from a slot returns to its rack.</p>
-        <p>The shared audio-effect picker groups choices into Space, Motion, Dirt and Colour. Track slots offer only note effects. On an empty shared slot, <kbd>OCT+</kbd> opens the browser: <kbd>KNOB 1</kbd> picks a family, <kbd>KNOB 2</kbd> an effect, and <kbd>OCT+</kbd> confirms. On a shared audio slot’s page, <kbd>KNOB 1</kbd> is MIX, <kbd>KNOB 2</kbd> is RATE / TIME / SIZE / DRIVE / BITS, and <kbd>KNOB 3</kbd> shapes its character. <kbd>KNOB 4</kbd> is TONE for ROOM and REVERB, SHAPE for DRIVE, or RESO for the swept pedals:</p>
+        <p>On a track’s rack, <kbd>KNOB 2</kbd> picks a row, <kbd>KNOB 1</kbd> chooses its effect, <kbd>KNOB 3</kbd> sets its <strong>ORDER</strong> (1st, 2nd, 3rd: the effect moves with all its controls, and the row follows), and <kbd>KNOB 4</kbd> sets its amount (MIX, NOTE TAIL’s REL, NOTE ECHO’s LEVEL, or the track’s SEND on the Shared row). Empty slots show <strong>--</strong>. <kbd>OCT+</kbd> opens the selected slot, its effect browser if empty, or the shared rack.</p>
+        <p>The effect picker groups choices into Space, Motion, Dirt and Colour (a track’s slots add Notes). On an empty slot, <kbd>OCT+</kbd> opens the browser: <kbd>KNOB 1</kbd> picks a family, <kbd>KNOB 2</kbd> an effect, and <kbd>OCT+</kbd> confirms. REVERB and DELAY run once each: choosing one in any slot, on any track or in SHARED, turns it off where it was.</p>
